{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I have lots of advice for you.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/43d1820e5f43a2a10c13c2aa627e5cf3cbd1044bcb17a35de3d129e5558276d6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.66]]}, {"text": "I just moved from a corporate job to rails consulting 2-4mo ago, because someone offered me more money than I could say no to.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/21f195b3a3b24e48d9ecfe5cba97cb8225b0e629c9888aaee2acf3fe2e3e1ee8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.6], [7, 1.6, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.6], [12, 3.6, 3.96], [13, 3.96, 4.28], [14, 4.28, 4.68], [15, 4.68, 4.86], [16, 4.86, 5.06], [17, 5.06, 5.34], [18, 5.34, 5.52], [19, 5.52, 5.66], [20, 5.66, 5.8], [21, 5.8, 5.98], [22, 5.98, 6.16], [23, 6.16, 6.38]]}, {"text": "Types of consultants", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/485051ccfd0ff2c2195d113892f017d8705ca3528a9d674671cb804e4769da0a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.92]]}, {"text": "This is my paradigm of freelance web/mobile consulting.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/45dee377fbe21c9c6859183f29adb53c87d3d24924c6240e51378444cff8c6df.mp3"}, {"text": "There are 4 types of developers that do this.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/14daab0e589f7d40df242dbc529afca8a78d804160e862178625b7e8a995c46a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [3, 0.46, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 2.04]]}, {"text": "The developer that is 30+ years old and has worked in a consulting corporate job for many years.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f1454ca1c1037225589501272cb7dad4893fb1f87cc6d6495faab1050d6f1648.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.1], [5, 1.3, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.26], [9, 2.26, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.72], [12, 2.82, 3.14], [13, 3.14, 3.58], [14, 3.58, 3.86], [15, 3.86, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.28], [17, 4.28, 4.72]]}, {"text": "He has a strong relationship with a handful of clients, and he leaves his job, takes the clients and now he has 2-3 companies that love him and will always give him work every year.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/47ff87a4ba9742cd6f1ed7622ca4f37fea98f264e6bf1b1f087de4e40f6ef627.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.52], [11, 3.06, 3.16], [12, 3.16, 3.44], [13, 3.44, 3.66], [14, 3.66, 3.94], [15, 4.38, 4.66], [16, 4.66, 4.84], [17, 4.84, 5.16], [18, 5.16, 5.4], [19, 5.4, 5.58], [20, 5.58, 5.8], [21, 5.8, 6.08], [23, 6.74, 7.1], [24, 7.1, 7.38], [25, 7.38, 7.6], [26, 7.6, 7.86], [27, 7.86, 8.12], [28, 8.12, 8.28], [29, 8.28, 8.58], [30, 8.58, 8.76], [31, 8.76, 8.94], [32, 8.94, 9.18], [33, 9.18, 9.48], [34, 9.48, 9.72]]}, {"text": "They only do work that they want to do and at the rate they want (Usually $120+/hr).", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d13a25de8a9f52bf1dec91c93fc32e6af4b13a32dea93e298e58aa6b67ba98b4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.34], [7, 1.34, 1.52], [8, 1.52, 1.7], [9, 1.7, 2.04], [10, 2.04, 2.14], [11, 2.14, 2.28], [12, 2.28, 2.44], [13, 2.44, 2.62], [14, 2.62, 2.82], [15, 3.14, 3.42]]}, {"text": "There are the developers that hopefully know coding really well, but they don’t have a strong network of clients.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/970bd66cb53a46361b000552a92c006ddd619d6a32b8209d69d2bca6f74c9d3c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.26], [9, 2.26, 2.58], [10, 3.12, 3.28], [11, 3.28, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.64], [14, 3.64, 3.7], [15, 3.7, 3.94], [16, 3.94, 4.22], [17, 4.22, 4.46], [18, 4.46, 4.8]]}, {"text": "They are probably looking online at oDesk/Freelancer, Twitter, or maybe posting on HN.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b46fc77448dd6bc76d73bfec57c2a7143353d1ded4d1235ae0b9be576678a2b1.mp3"}, {"text": "They probably have a website and maybe their SEO rank is super awesome for a “{technology} {city}” search in Google.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/05d7a5c4b25ff0745866f6f1f6fa42e209678261f01fd1fa2d3fa9050f5207f3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.66], [10, 2.66, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.14], [12, 3.14, 3.5], [13, 3.5, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.26], [15, 5.36, 6.0], [16, 6.7, 7.34], [17, 7.34, 8.32], [18, 8.32, 8.6], [19, 8.6, 8.92]]}, {"text": "This type may even pay for services like LeadSugar.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/32ce2c48b25767a0e09c4a13dbbd175282c4b6d346f7f9767beab38646d699d1.mp3"}, {"text": "I have never subscribed to websites like that, but I feel like the most profitable awesome contracts are not going to be found posted publicly online.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5bb19bb133671f2362c69754379a0175c8feb7d6064147182540fe1928605dcd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.52], [6, 1.52, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.06], [8, 2.22, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.42], [10, 2.42, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 2.76], [12, 2.76, 2.9], [13, 2.9, 3.14], [14, 3.14, 3.72], [15, 3.86, 4.22], [16, 4.22, 4.68], [17, 4.68, 4.96], [18, 4.96, 5.16], [19, 5.16, 5.34], [20, 5.34, 5.46], [21, 5.46, 5.56], [22, 5.56, 5.8], [23, 5.8, 6.16], [24, 6.16, 6.58], [25, 6.58, 7.02]]}, {"text": "This would be a graduate of type two, where they have 2-3 companies that love them, that will always put food on the table, and hopefully pay them what they want to get paid.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e6c60febad6ebf9eb9677484cee3f94ab84fd3f6eebcb3c31467dbf91781a890.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.58], [4, 0.58, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.28], [8, 1.64, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.38], [12, 3.1, 3.5], [13, 3.5, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.06], [15, 4.06, 4.42], [16, 4.68, 4.8], [17, 4.8, 4.94], [18, 4.94, 5.26], [19, 5.26, 5.48], [20, 5.48, 5.76], [21, 5.76, 5.98], [22, 5.98, 6.1], [23, 6.1, 6.4], [24, 6.4, 6.92], [25, 6.92, 7.28], [26, 7.28, 7.6], [27, 7.6, 7.82], [28, 7.82, 8.0], [29, 8.0, 8.18], [30, 8.18, 8.38], [31, 8.38, 8.58], [32, 8.58, 8.7], [33, 8.7, 9.0]]}, {"text": "I feel like there is a bit of luck to get here, but not impossible.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/67ed3091a95525249f1347b91add84f7c50720e23573844d166cb3511e355696.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.46], [5, 0.72, 0.82], [6, 0.82, 0.9], [7, 0.9, 1.08], [8, 1.08, 1.18], [9, 1.18, 1.38], [10, 1.38, 1.5], [11, 1.5, 1.72], [12, 1.94, 2.06], [13, 2.06, 2.44], [14, 2.44, 2.98]]}, {"text": "I do not know a single developer in this type.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3902cde44c46d706200e5d96219f1eed6e6601a4402c0fc9404439501717b652.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.06], [9, 2.06, 2.36]]}, {"text": "The last type is a type 2 developer, that a type 1 person is giving extra work to that they don’t want to do or can’t do.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/51c5850850908cf51fc3acca7926638d96dac6748eaebc62761e6c4b3161db38.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 2.12], [9, 2.7, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.02], [11, 3.02, 3.24], [12, 3.24, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 4.12], [14, 4.12, 4.42], [15, 4.42, 4.98], [16, 4.98, 5.3], [17, 5.3, 5.5], [18, 5.5, 5.64], [19, 5.64, 5.8], [20, 5.8, 6.06], [21, 6.06, 6.18], [22, 6.18, 6.3], [23, 6.3, 6.48], [24, 6.48, 6.86], [25, 6.86, 7.32], [26, 7.32, 7.48]]}, {"text": "They share a piece of the pie with you, because they want to grow their consultancies into a developer shop, or maybe they just want to work on other things, but they still want to capitalize on their network.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1934778d02de276e81b80b2d6452a9206518b39960a988377175f08528f8988d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.08], [6, 1.08, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.52], [8, 1.52, 1.74], [9, 1.74, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.34], [11, 2.34, 2.48], [12, 2.48, 2.62], [13, 2.62, 2.8], [14, 2.8, 3.02], [15, 3.02, 3.78], [16, 3.78, 4.16], [17, 4.16, 4.28], [18, 4.28, 4.62], [19, 4.62, 4.98], [20, 5.3, 5.52], [21, 5.52, 5.8], [22, 5.8, 5.96], [23, 5.96, 6.14], [24, 6.14, 6.32], [25, 6.32, 6.48], [26, 6.48, 6.64], [27, 6.64, 6.8], [28, 6.8, 7.02], [29, 7.02, 7.44], [30, 7.8, 7.96], [31, 7.96, 8.1], [33, 8.34, 8.48], [34, 8.48, 8.58], [35, 8.58, 9.02], [36, 9.02, 9.28], [37, 9.28, 9.4], [38, 9.4, 9.72]]}, {"text": "I am a type 2 developer, that knows several type 1 developers, and thus ended up in type 4.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/059a05d9e8c071eb3dc960f4ce234f87d19ebd2d707e67a066f3cab9d864379e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.5], [4, 0.66, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.3], [12, 3.68, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.08], [14, 4.08, 4.32], [15, 4.32, 4.54], [16, 4.54, 4.64], [17, 4.64, 4.8], [18, 4.8, 5.16]]}, {"text": "I have found that most of the jobs posted publicly, where type 2s look for work, are low paying and terrible.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a512cafb99cb07651d312ad879c90666cbee335a510286af34c3169d76508a9b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.22], [7, 1.22, 1.4], [8, 1.4, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.32], [11, 2.78, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.4], [13, 3.4, 3.48], [14, 3.48, 3.66], [15, 3.66, 3.98], [16, 3.98, 4.4], [17, 4.4, 4.62], [18, 4.62, 4.96], [20, 5.18, 5.54]]}, {"text": "The clients posting them look at development as a commodity and aim for the lowest bidder.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/20c9f9ba607924e3bde9484896a435d6ea132b55a5c0eb20b60992d9eb34195c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.36], [6, 1.36, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.96], [11, 2.96, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.46], [14, 3.46, 3.64], [15, 3.64, 4.0]]}, {"text": "There are tons (corporate full timers looking to augment income, college kids, 3rd world, etc.)", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2fe422413f867aab8227c17b9948338dd720066ef24ce883b92ecaa47b5e8491.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.64], [3, 0.94, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.96], [6, 1.96, 2.24], [7, 2.24, 2.48], [8, 2.48, 2.8], [9, 2.8, 3.24], [10, 3.74, 3.9], [11, 3.9, 4.26], [13, 4.6, 4.9], [14, 5.02, 5.3]]}, {"text": "of type 2 developers looking to fill these gigs.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c226a672c4cb298c5fbb3bb96130c556a76eba7120c81699a6c1d24bd10e380a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.3]]}, {"text": "Most of these gigs pay low.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d460058f4c523414c52eeba11e9b36fa722029c535e705049e5d1234e1d72647.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.36]]}, {"text": "They want to spend $500 to build Facebook.com for puppies and they will have at least 8 people bidding on their project.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7f4ad7abbbf48511ea83eb24efe4d5ea478f7eecfd1da412593fdf346200451c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.06], [8, 2.9, 3.18], [9, 3.18, 3.46], [10, 3.46, 3.92], [11, 3.92, 4.02], [12, 4.02, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.28], [14, 4.28, 4.42], [15, 4.42, 4.52], [17, 4.86, 5.2], [18, 5.2, 5.42], [19, 5.42, 5.6], [20, 5.6, 5.74], [21, 5.74, 6.16]]}, {"text": "Actionable Advice", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7fc275492b665400f9b41acec289f1a8243af472ac9080c2a77f14c318e912b2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 0.92]]}, {"text": "If you have a terrible portfolio, look at doing a few bad jobs off of oDesk to build that out.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/baaa156a69ac9a95d8a9481b4e6aad6cd4e55268db86513f8789f782a368c012.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.58], [6, 2.2, 2.32], [7, 2.32, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.82], [10, 2.82, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.2], [12, 3.2, 3.46], [13, 3.46, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 3.98], [15, 3.98, 4.42], [16, 4.42, 4.58], [17, 4.58, 4.78], [18, 4.78, 4.96], [19, 4.96, 5.16]]}, {"text": "Write super awesome code and get good at what you do.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/50fac5399ccec31158310309a7ce9b8122288ff2119ae5f3c70d2d1a641096f8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.76], [8, 1.76, 1.88], [9, 1.88, 2.04], [10, 2.04, 2.26]]}, {"text": "You need to set yourself apart, skill wise, from all of the other developers.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e7fbf2390fcd152ca544e3d6c122e911c87ce76924abd155a8f18c872efe212a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.2], [6, 1.44, 1.6], [8, 2.16, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.76], [12, 2.76, 2.9], [13, 2.9, 3.34]]}, {"text": "Riches are in the niches.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c954b8a292d1df089be6d135dddd41fa9fe3ccf677668435f8d050466b893056.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.4]]}, {"text": "I met a developer last week that started programming at age 28, 4 years ago, and he has gotten really good at WebRTC.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c0418818ded56005e10648505bbc4850a38beea5a234d536a6333ba47c15f8e5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.8], [11, 2.8, 3.34], [13, 3.86, 4.06], [14, 4.06, 4.34], [15, 4.8, 5.0], [16, 5.0, 5.16], [17, 5.16, 5.3], [18, 5.3, 5.44], [19, 5.44, 5.8], [20, 5.8, 6.06], [21, 6.06, 6.22], [22, 6.22, 6.78]]}, {"text": "He is one of a very few ‘experts’ on the stack in South East USA and anyone that wants WebRTC consulting has to talk with him.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e48d383af7254517d50948befd707b0cdd43f167f704c2a484074c29fbbd96d6.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.42, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 2.92], [8, 2.92, 3.34], [9, 3.34, 3.48], [10, 3.48, 3.78], [11, 3.78, 4.1], [14, 4.6, 5.14], [15, 5.14, 5.56], [16, 5.56, 5.94], [17, 5.94, 6.12], [18, 6.12, 6.38], [19, 6.38, 7.04], [20, 7.04, 7.68], [21, 7.68, 7.98], [22, 7.98, 8.16], [23, 8.16, 8.34], [24, 8.34, 8.56], [25, 8.56, 8.76]]}, {"text": "I am sure he is terrible at programming, but if he is the only webrtc pro, then that is all that matters.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6bb4aab1c2713687f9fe6ebad6e209a279ec7c78d5414cc7f2ef014f5338c5de.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.84], [8, 2.22, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.42], [10, 2.42, 2.56], [11, 2.56, 2.7], [12, 2.7, 2.8], [13, 2.8, 3.04], [15, 3.44, 3.7], [16, 4.02, 4.1], [17, 4.1, 4.28], [18, 4.28, 4.44], [19, 4.44, 4.58], [20, 4.58, 4.72], [21, 4.72, 5.04]]}, {"text": "Find a niche.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3c3260e400a066df7887a78f25ff924839f0b1387c85608a1c032ffac8db8873.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.8]]}, {"text": "Attend tech (ruby on rails, android, etc) meetups.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8ba3cfb2a5da291480c56a0388c5454060a9b4361dca7bad2c210c810de095ef.mp3"}, {"text": "I have a pretty strong network of developers and one of them took me under his wing and has been handing me his client work.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c27a2c4cbdf71e23395cc4ba141de735c27359907f4e2edd14a8510703380307.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 2.06], [9, 2.48, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 2.96], [12, 2.96, 3.1], [13, 3.1, 3.3], [14, 3.3, 3.46], [15, 3.46, 3.64], [16, 3.64, 3.82], [17, 3.82, 4.06], [18, 4.06, 4.2], [19, 4.2, 4.3], [20, 4.3, 4.58], [21, 4.58, 4.74], [22, 4.74, 4.9], [23, 4.9, 5.14], [24, 5.14, 5.44]]}, {"text": "He is taking money off the top, but I am still making my rate (which is at least 2x what I would expect from oDesk jobs), so I am happy.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d8f3d33d1ea568e129d8e78270fe50c577a976b6208092d7bf100a935978c1a4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.48], [7, 1.92, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.16], [9, 2.16, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.48], [11, 2.48, 2.78], [12, 2.78, 3.0], [13, 3.0, 3.26], [14, 3.54, 3.7], [15, 3.7, 3.86], [16, 3.86, 3.96], [17, 3.96, 4.14], [18, 4.14, 4.8], [19, 4.8, 4.92], [20, 4.92, 5.04], [21, 5.04, 5.16], [22, 5.16, 5.44], [23, 5.44, 5.78], [24, 5.78, 6.26], [25, 6.26, 6.5], [26, 7.16, 7.42], [27, 7.42, 7.54], [28, 7.54, 7.62], [29, 7.62, 7.9]]}, {"text": "You will not find direct clients at tech meet ups, but you might can find mentors or other consultants that have too much on their plate.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/62252d236ac2736cb615630edc28d87e6711e42600dba5603408db6f69ba5686.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.96], [10, 2.58, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.04], [14, 3.6, 3.84], [15, 3.84, 4.14], [16, 4.14, 4.38], [17, 4.38, 4.58], [18, 4.58, 5.08], [19, 5.08, 5.3], [20, 5.3, 5.46], [21, 5.46, 5.66], [22, 5.66, 5.84], [23, 5.84, 5.96], [24, 5.96, 6.1], [25, 6.1, 6.32]]}, {"text": "Attend non-tech events in industries known to need and use technology (marketing, sales, small business, etc.).", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a6bb78f7146c5c85b1698b406c5666fd240dc89ad9a37c7eae3ba29cb710b758.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.92, 1.32], [3, 1.32, 1.54], [4, 1.54, 1.98], [5, 1.98, 2.34], [6, 2.34, 2.54], [7, 2.54, 2.74], [8, 2.74, 2.94], [9, 2.94, 3.16], [10, 3.16, 3.8], [11, 4.2, 4.64], [12, 5.08, 5.32], [13, 5.86, 6.02], [14, 6.02, 6.34], [15, 6.7, 6.94]]}, {"text": "You want industries that make a lot of money, and already pay for technology.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94beef1558f74ece0b330a3caa9eb2d1aa362841443f35a17f3477338eda2598.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 1.72], [8, 1.72, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.08], [12, 3.08, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.76]]}, {"text": "Hopefully you will find projects here like: “I need my sales force account hooked into my Infusionsoft account with Twilio integration so that I can be notified about new clients.”", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f54157b864831a8cbca28bf0269724341c791834e84b4ae16cb02dc3d2cb5f37.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.08], [8, 2.54, 2.72], [9, 2.72, 2.94], [12, 3.32, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.16], [14, 4.16, 4.36], [15, 4.36, 4.58], [17, 5.24, 5.56], [18, 5.56, 5.88], [19, 5.88, 6.26], [21, 6.98, 7.2], [22, 7.2, 7.3], [23, 7.3, 7.44], [24, 7.44, 7.58], [25, 7.58, 7.7], [26, 7.7, 8.06], [27, 8.06, 8.4], [28, 8.4, 8.58], [29, 8.58, 8.94]]}, {"text": "I have talked before about my experiences at Goodie Hack.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f792b1973237117c3225b4b30b6153ba0300d2a722c8897980c0ef1983b5deea.mp3"}, {"text": "There were very few developers there and lots of people looking for them.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/68ac77142cb75911d1a81af80e810e7c89f33ee8d864dfa7ae65b6adb6cc97db.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 1.96], [9, 1.96, 2.12], [10, 2.12, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.58], [12, 2.58, 2.76]]}, {"text": "Reverse sale recruiters.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2f15d0cec1100c75a36c903a4599e63004a1dbae9fade71da356a304bbf1c3c1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.54], [2, 0.72, 1.52]]}, {"text": "I get hit up by recruiters weekly asking if I want to work at the “hottest start up in ___.”", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a3e40944f3921ee825363f865d66b000e07b6b0d0f1f1d0e869ad773ac624bb8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.74], [5, 0.74, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.24], [10, 2.24, 2.42], [11, 2.42, 2.54], [12, 2.54, 2.7], [13, 2.7, 2.88], [14, 2.88, 3.06], [15, 3.06, 3.36], [18, 3.76, 4.04]]}, {"text": "I say, “Hey, I am not looking for a position right now, but I am looking to take on new contracts.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ae15e6b2b0b3f7fb7800b28e3c1d59da0307e4f86a09a8410d9353f605ecd523.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.5], [5, 1.68, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.3], [12, 3.7, 3.84], [13, 3.84, 3.96], [14, 3.96, 4.06], [15, 4.06, 4.26], [16, 4.26, 4.46], [17, 4.46, 4.62], [18, 4.62, 4.78], [19, 4.78, 4.9], [20, 4.9, 5.3]]}, {"text": "I will give you $500 gift card, if you refer a client to me and we seal a +1 month contract.”", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94ca296153d17d85caafbe5dbb493ddb75c692c13468cd2be9f8fdd4ad496938.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.22], [2, 0.22, 0.36], [3, 0.36, 0.5], [4, 0.5, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 1.96], [9, 1.96, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.62], [12, 2.62, 2.8], [13, 2.8, 2.94], [15, 3.62, 3.76], [16, 3.76, 4.0], [17, 4.0, 4.1], [19, 4.58, 4.76], [20, 4.76, 5.26]]}, {"text": "Now I got a little team of people interested in helping me out.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/dd829bae8edafa82c0f7d149212b626cceebf9814bc0c62ac11e25eed136bd8b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.88], [12, 2.88, 3.1]]}, {"text": "Attend startup events.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f77f0b5be71abd88a423fe9d27eafed54f9d8a1281e3725d8ece1e80b9122d01.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [2, 0.92, 1.24]]}, {"text": "There are lots of people that have ideas, raised millions of dollars, but don’t have the tech talent to build what they want to build.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a142f8223e0ebe10b95cfadfe774b3665117504614cb5dd8aaa764ee09756bd7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.54], [7, 1.54, 2.02], [8, 2.6, 2.78], [9, 2.78, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.38], [11, 3.38, 3.74], [12, 4.12, 4.34], [13, 4.34, 4.68], [14, 4.68, 4.82], [15, 4.82, 5.02], [16, 5.02, 5.24], [17, 5.24, 5.64], [18, 5.64, 5.84], [19, 5.84, 6.04], [20, 6.04, 6.24], [21, 6.24, 6.38], [22, 6.38, 6.58], [23, 6.58, 6.74], [24, 6.74, 7.04]]}, {"text": "You need to find these people.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9204f19cb535cf6fdd6fde4473571ff4183eeb0f8adb59a0d006c82888639b84.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.24]]}, {"text": "Build relationships with VC firms.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/439893ca1b8572577bed15f90822899c98fae0fd7930cd1adc4acc1023e234d3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.22], [3, 1.22, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 2.0]]}, {"text": "There are lots of startups with a $200,000 tech budget and no one to spend it on.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5a8ad40c4ad474188e28b6ef3eb9043e1dedb9d27fc0f1755babc668af83ebec.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.34], [8, 2.26, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 3.74], [13, 3.74, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.08], [15, 4.08, 4.24], [16, 4.24, 4.42]]}]}